{"sourceUrl":"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1035/6941.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.692916+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1035/6941.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，中南大学湘雅基础医学院决定举办</span><span>2025年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日活动（以下简称开放日活动），现就开放日活动相关事项通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、活动宗旨</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>开放日活动旨在搭建学院与学生交流互动平台，活动期间学员有机会了解学院研究生招生政策，聆听知名学者讲座，与相关专业教授进行交流，促进师生之间的相互了解，感受学校良好的教学科研氛围。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>届优秀本科生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请专业含基础医学、生物学、电子信息、生物与医药；具体研究方向可参考</span></span><a href=\"https://yz.csu.edu.cn/info/1011/1310.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span><span>《中南大学</span><span>2025年硕士研究生招生简章》</span></span></span></strong></a><span><span>（</span><span>https://yz.csu.edu.cn/info/1011/1310.htm）、</span></span><a href=\"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1037/6491.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span><span>《中南大学湘雅基础医学院</span><span>2025年硕士研究生招生简章相关说明》</span></span></span></strong></a><span><span>（</span><span>https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1037/6491.htm）</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>三、报名时间与方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>—7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名方式：线上报名，登录</span></span><strong><span><span>“</span></span></strong><a href=\"https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span><span>中南大学</span><span>2025年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日</span></span></span></strong></a><strong><span><span>”</span></span></strong><span><span>网站报</span></span><span><span>名，报名链接：</span></span><a href=\"https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></span></span></a><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>同时扫码加入湘雅基础医学院优秀大学生招生宣传开放日微信群。</span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><br/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/__local/4/A2/20/0E4AA4365E3002E83E12C74718F_894078DE_FD9E.png\"/></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> <span><span>四、活动</span></span><span><span>时间</span></span><span><span>与方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办时间：</span></span><span><span>2025年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办方式：线下举办。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、资格审查</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2025年7月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日前</span></span><span><span>完成对报名学生的报名审查，学生可通过报名网站点击</span><span>“申请状态查询”，如状态为“申请信息院系审核合格”即为取得参加资格。有意愿参加我院暑期招生宣讲开放日活动的学生，请于现场签到时提交如下材料：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>本人身份证和学生证复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>网上报名《申请表》一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span><span>个人简历。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、具体活动安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）活动时间：</span></span><span><span>2025年7月19日全天</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）活动方式：线下</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）活动安排：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>①7月19日8:10-8:30：学生报到（中南大学杏林校区、具体地点另行通过微信群和QQ群通知）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②7月19日8:30-12:00：学院组织，含欢迎仪式、招生政策宣讲、升学指导、参观国家级科普基地-人体形态学标本馆等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>③7月19日14:30-17:30：学院各招生系所组织，含与招生导师面对面交流、参观实验室等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>④</span></span><span><span>7月19日17:30，本次开放日活动结束。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、其他说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。凡在报名等各环节中弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消参加</span></span><span><span>开放日活动</span></span><span><span>资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>期间，请注意保证安全问题，如人身、财产、交通安全等，必须遵守中南大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>本次活动食宿自理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>易</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0731-</span></span><span><span>88660440 </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><span><span>315024625@qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：</span></span><span><span>中南大学杏林校区孝骞楼</span><span>709</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湘雅基础医学院研究生</span><span>招生</span><span>QQ群：113645896</span></span> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>中南大学湘雅基础医学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                                <span>2025年7月2日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"32946f3727dc736474218569dc04c0e09cad3ca15b3fb90c46c75e4aa9b853ae","textLength":1309,"sourceSha256":"761330d81c5b52182f82244a8bd57cd07a41a050d1c4e450de5e4a304120d6c9","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ef7f773a9a5a615be344","title":"2025年中南大学湘雅基础医学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.692916+00:00"}
